sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant FE as React
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant S3 as Amazon S3
  FE->>API: POST /api/recommendations/{id}/apply
  API->>DB: BEGIN, lock documents row (FOR UPDATE)
  API->>API: re-run engine on current data
  alt result differs from stored recommendation
    API->>DB: mark recommendation STALE, COMMIT
    API-->>FE: 409 STALE_RECOMMENDATION
  else same
    API->>S3: CopyObject onto same key with new StorageClass (old VersionId as source)
    S3-->>API: new VersionId
    API->>DB: update version row (s3_version_id, storage_class, storage_class_changed_at), recommendation APPLIED, COMMIT
    API->>S3: DeleteObject with OLD VersionId (best effort)
    API-->>FE: 200
  end
